---
import ToolLayout from '../layouts/ToolLayout.astro';
---

<ToolLayout slug="resize">
  <section slot="hero" class="tool-hero">
    <div class="tool-hero__copy">
      <h1>在线图片缩放，<br>改尺寸不拉伸。</h1>
      <p class="tool-benefit">按百分比或指定宽高缩放图片，保持宽高比，双三次插值保证放大质量。本地处理，图片不上传。</p>
      <div class="dropzone" id="dropzone" role="button" tabindex="0">
        <span class="dropzone__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path d="M12 16V4"/><path d="m7 9 5-5 5 5"/><path d="M5 15v4h14v-4"/></svg>
        </span>
        <span class="dropzone__main">
          <b>点击选择图片，或拖到这里</b>
          <span>JPG / PNG / WebP · 图片不离开本机</span>
        </span>
        <input type="file" id="fileInput" accept="image/*">
      </div>
      <p class="tool-note">比例 / 像素 · 保持宽高比 · 0 上传</p>
    </div>

    <div class="demo-stage stage-resize">
      <span class="stage-note">示例 · 保持 3:2</span>
      <div class="dim-row"><span class="small">原图</span><span class="big">1200 × 800</span><span class="small">→</span><span class="big">800 × 533</span></div>
      <div class="dim-frame"><img src="/assets/demo/resize-after.jpg" alt="缩放示例：800×533 的瓶子" loading="lazy"></div>
      <div class="dim-caption"><span>宽高比不变</span><span>双三次插值</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="work-section hidden" id="workArea">
    <div class="work-head"><h2>缩放设置</h2><div class="work-head-actions"><span>本地处理 · 0 上传</span><button class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" type="button" data-reset>换一张</button></div></div>
<div class="work-grid">
        <div class="controls">
          <div class="control">
            <label for="mode">缩放方式</label>
            <select id="mode">
              <option value="percent">按百分比</option>
              <option value="pixels">按像素尺寸</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="control" id="percentCtrl">
            <label for="percent">缩放比例 <span id="percentVal">50</span>%</label>
            <input type="range" id="percent" min="5" max="200" value="50">
          </div>
          <div class="control hidden" id="pixelCtrl">
            <label for="pixelW">宽度（px）</label>
            <input type="number" id="pixelW" min="1" max="8192" placeholder="自动">
          </div>
          <div class="control hidden" id="pixelCtrlH">
            <label for="pixelH">高度（px）</label>
            <input type="number" id="pixelH" min="1" max="8192" placeholder="自动">
          </div>
          <div class="control">
            <label for="keepRatio">保持宽高比</label>
            <select id="keepRatio"><option value="true">是</option><option value="false">否</option></select>
          </div>
          <div class="control">
            <label for="interp">放大插值</label>
            <select id="interp">
              <option value="high">高质量（双三次）</option>
              <option value="low">快速（双线性）</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="control">
            <label for="outFmt">输出格式</label>
            <select id="outFmt">
              <option value="image/png">PNG</option>
              <option value="image/jpeg">JPG</option>
              <option value="image/webp">WebP</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="controls-actions">
            <button class="btn btn-primary" id="btnExport">导出缩放图</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="compare">
          <div class="compare-box">
            <h3>原图</h3>
            <img id="previewOrig" src="/assets/demo/resize-before.jpg" alt="原图">
            <div class="compare-meta" id="metaOrig"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="compare-box">
            <h3>缩放后</h3>
            <img id="previewResult" src="/assets/demo/resize-after.jpg" alt="缩放后">
            <div class="compare-meta" id="metaResult"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
  </section>

  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step"><span class="n">01</span><div><b>放入图片</b><p>先读取原图尺寸，文件不上传。</p></div></div>
    <div class="step"><span class="n">02</span><div><b>定尺寸</b><p>按百分比，或直接填目标宽高；锁定宽高比。</p></div></div>
    <div class="step"><span class="n">03</span><div><b>导出</b><p>选 PNG、JPG 或 WebP，按目标尺寸输出。</p></div></div>
  </div>

  <section class="rate">
    <h2>按比例缩放怎么算</h2>
    <p>目标尺寸 = 原图尺寸 × 比例，宽和高乘同一个数，长宽比不变。以 1200 × 800 为例：</p>
    <table class="rate-table">
      <caption>按比例缩小计算尺寸</caption>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>比例</th><th>目标尺寸</th><th>长边变化</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>90%</td><td>1080 × 720</td><td>长边 1200 → 1080</td></tr>
        <tr><td>75%</td><td>900 × 600</td><td>长边 1200 → 900</td></tr>
        <tr><td>50%</td><td>600 × 400</td><td>长边 1200 → 600</td></tr>
        <tr><td>33%</td><td>396 × 264</td><td>长边 1200 → 396</td></tr>
        <tr><td>25%</td><td>300 × 200</td><td>长边 1200 → 300</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>连续缩两次就把比例相乘：先 50% 再 50%，等于一次 25%，1200 × 800 一路变成 300 × 200。中间别四舍五入，最后一步再取整。</p>
  </section>

  <script is:inline src="/js/common.js"></script>
  <script is:inline src="/js/resize.js"></script>
</ToolLayout>
